{{!
    @template format_aicourse/section_card

    A single section card in the AI Course course home grid.

    The card title link is the only element in the card that is exposed to assistive technology;
    the time badge, the activity count and the percentage badge repeat information that is already
    in the title link's accessible name, so they are removed from the tab order and the
    accessibility tree (tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true") to satisfy WCAG 2.4.4. Every decorative
    SVG carries aria-hidden="true" focusable="false".

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-card - the card root, read by amd/src/courseformat.js.
    * aicourse-card-settings
    * aicourse-card-duplicate - AJAX duplicate handler.
    * aicourse-card-delete - AJAX delete handler.
    * aicourse-card-icon-editable - opens the icon picker modal.
    * aicourse-card-drag-handle - the grab handle bound by amd/src/local/sectioncardhandle.js.
    * aicourse-card-bulkselect - wrapper that pins core's bulk selection checkbox to the card.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-section, data-sectionid, data-courseid, data-sectionnum - read by
      amd/src/courseformat.js for the duplicate, delete and icon actions.
    * data-for="section", data-id, data-number on the card root and data-for="section_title" on the
      title - the attributes core_courseformat's reactive state manager binds to.
    * data-drag-type="section" on the grab handle - selects the element
      format_aicourse/local/sectioncard makes draggable.
    * data-action="moveSection" with data-id on the grab handle - dispatched by core's own
      core_courseformat/local/content/actions, which opens the keyboard accessible move dialogue.
    * data-for="sectionBulkSelect" with a data-bulkcheckbox input inside it, emitted by core's own
      core_courseformat/local/content/section/bulkselect partial - shown, checked and disabled by
      format_aicourse/local/sectioncard from the reactive bulk state, and found by core's bulk
      edit tools when the teacher uses "Select all".

    Context variables required for this template:
    * sectionid int Section record ID.
    * sectionnum int Section number.
    * courseid int Course ID.
    * sectionurl string Unescaped section URL.
    * sectionname string PRE-ESCAPED section name (already through format_string()); rendered with
      a triple mustache so the entities format_string() produced are not escaped twice.
    * isediting bool True when the teacher has edit mode turned on.
    * uselistroles bool True when role="listitem" should be emitted.
    * sectionbulk object|null Context for core_courseformat/local/content/section/bulkselect
      ({id, name}), or null when the section cannot take part in a bulk selection.
    * showeditbuttons bool True when the card edit controls should be rendered.
    * editsectionurl string Unescaped URL of the section settings page (edit mode only).
    * editsectionlabel string Accessible name of the settings link (edit mode only).
    * editsectiontitle string Tooltip of the settings link (edit mode only).
    * duplicatelabel string Accessible name of the duplicate button (edit mode only).
    * duplicatetitle string Tooltip of the duplicate button (edit mode only).
    * deletelabel string Accessible name of the delete button (edit mode only).
    * deletetitle string Tooltip of the delete button (edit mode only).
    * movelabel string Accessible name of the move / drag handle (edit mode only).
    * movetitle string Tooltip of the move / drag handle (edit mode only).
    * iconbuttonlabel string Accessible name of the icon picker button (edit mode only).
    * hasicon bool True when the teacher has chosen an icon for this section.
    * iconsvg string PRE-ESCAPED SVG child markup taken from the plugin's own icon library
      (\format_aicourse\local\icons::get_library()); it is plugin-defined constant markup, never
      user input, so it is rendered with a triple mustache.
    * hastime bool True when an estimated study time is known.
    * estimatedtime string Localised estimated study time, e.g. "25 min".
    * cardlinklabel string Accessible name of the card title link.
    * hassummary bool True when a truncated section summary should be shown.
    * summary string Plain-text truncated section summary.
    * hasactivities bool True when the course option "Show activities on cards" is on AND this
      section holds at least one activity the user may see. False (the default) emits nothing.
    * activities array Objects with url (PRE-ESCAPED by moodle_url::out() or s()), name
      (PRE-ESCAPED by format_string()), label (the accessible name, plain text) and stateclass
      (one of aicourse-actstate-completed / -in_progress / -not_started / -none).
    * moreactivities object|null Overflow link with url (unescaped), remaining and label, or null
      when every activity in the section is already listed.
    * hasfooter bool True when the card footer should be rendered.
    * hascount bool True when the activity count should be rendered.
    * counttext string Localised activity count, e.g. "3 activities".
    * hasprogress bool True when completion tracking gives this section a percentage.
    * badgeclass string CSS class of the percentage badge.
    * percenttext string Localised percentage, e.g. "33%".
    * hasdots bool True when the compact progress dots should be rendered.
    * dots array Objects with url (PRE-ESCAPED by moodle_url::out()), statusclass and label.
    * moredots object|null Overflow link with url (unescaped), remaining and title.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "sectionid": 35,
        "sectionnum": 1,
        "courseid": 2,
        "sectionurl": "https://example.org/course/section.php?id=35",
        "sectionname": "Module 1: Foundations",
        "isediting": false,
        "uselistroles": true,
        "sectionbulk": null,
        "showeditbuttons": false,
        "editsectionurl": "https://example.org/course/editsection.php?id=35&amp;sr=0",
        "editsectionlabel": "Edit section: Module 1: Foundations",
        "editsectiontitle": "Edit section",
        "duplicatelabel": "Duplicate section: Module 1: Foundations",
        "duplicatetitle": "Duplicate section",
        "deletelabel": "Delete section: Module 1: Foundations",
        "deletetitle": "Delete section",
        "movelabel": "Move Module 1: Foundations",
        "movetitle": "Move section",
        "iconbuttonlabel": "Add an icon for Module 1: Foundations",
        "hasicon": false,
        "iconsvg": "",
        "hastime": true,
        "estimatedtime": "25 min",
        "cardlinklabel": "Module 1: Foundations, 3 activities, Estimated time 25 min, 33% complete",
        "hassummary": true,
        "summary": "What machine learning is and why it matters.",
        "hasactivities": true,
        "activities": [
            {
                "url": "https://example.org/mod/page/view.php?id=12",
                "name": "What is machine learning?",
                "label": "What is machine learning?, Module 1: Foundations (Completed)",
                "stateclass": "aicourse-actstate-completed",
                "cmid": 12,
                "iconurl": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/page/1/monologo",
                "modname": "page",
                "typename": "Page",
                "hastime": true,
                "timetext": "5 min",
                "iscomplete": true,
                "istracked": true
            },
            {
                "url": "https://example.org/mod/quiz/view.php?id=13",
                "name": "Foundations knowledge check",
                "label": "Foundations knowledge check, Module 1: Foundations (Not Started)",
                "stateclass": "aicourse-actstate-not_started",
                "cmid": 13,
                "iconurl": "https://example.org/theme/image.php/boost/quiz/1/monologo",
                "modname": "quiz",
                "typename": "Quiz",
                "hastime": true,
                "timetext": "15 min",
                "iscomplete": false,
                "istracked": true
            }
        ],
        "moreactivities": {
            "url": "https://example.org/course/section.php?id=35",
            "remaining": 1,
            "label": "View all activities in Module 1: Foundations"
        },
        "hasfooter": true,
        "hascount": true,
        "counttext": "3 activities",
        "hasprogress": true,
        "badgeclass": "aicourse-progress-badge",
        "percenttext": "33%",
        "percentnum": 33,
        "ringdash": 33.17,
        "hasdots": true,
        "dots": [
            {
                "url": "https://example.org/mod/page/view.php?id=12",
                "statusclass": "aicourse-dot-completed",
                "label": "What is machine learning? (Completed)"
            },
            {
                "url": "https://example.org/mod/quiz/view.php?id=13",
                "statusclass": "aicourse-dot-not_started",
                "label": "Foundations knowledge check (Not Started)"
            }
        ],
        "moredots": {
            "url": "https://example.org/course/section.php?id=35",
            "remaining": 2,
            "title": "View all activities"
        }
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-card" data-section="{{sectionnum}}" data-sectionid="{{sectionid}}"{{#uselistroles}} role="listitem"{{/uselistroles}} data-for="section" data-id="{{sectionid}}" data-number="{{sectionnum}}">
{{#sectionbulk}}
<div class="aicourse-card-bulkselect">
{{> core_courseformat/local/content/section/bulkselect }}
</div>
{{/sectionbulk}}
{{#showeditbuttons}}
<div class="aicourse-card-edit-buttons">
<button type="button" class="aicourse-card-drag-handle" data-action="moveSection" data-id="{{sectionid}}" data-drag-type="section" aria-label="{{movelabel}}" title="{{movetitle}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="5" r="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="12" r="1"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="5" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="12" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="19" r="1"/></svg></button><a href="{{editsectionurl}}" class="aicourse-card-settings" aria-label="{{editsectionlabel}}" title="{{editsectiontitle}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></a><button type="button" class="aicourse-card-duplicate" data-sectionid="{{sectionid}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" aria-label="{{duplicatelabel}}" title="{{duplicatetitle}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="aicourse-card-delete" data-sectionid="{{sectionid}}" data-sectionnum="{{sectionnum}}" aria-label="{{deletelabel}}" title="{{deletetitle}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button>
</div>
{{/showeditbuttons}}
<div class="aicourse-card-header">
{{#isediting}}
<button type="button" class="aicourse-icon-col aicourse-card-icon-editable" aria-label="{{iconbuttonlabel}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" data-sectionid="{{sectionid}}">{{> format_aicourse/section_icon }}<span class="aicourse-icon-change-label">{{#hasicon}}{{#str}} changeicon, format_aicourse {{/str}}{{/hasicon}}{{^hasicon}}{{#str}} addicon, format_aicourse {{/str}}{{/hasicon}}</span></button>
{{/isediting}}
{{^isediting}}
{{> format_aicourse/section_icon }}
{{/isediting}}
{{#hastime}}
<a href="{{sectionurl}}" class="aicourse-card-time" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg><span>{{estimatedtime}}</span></a>
{{/hastime}}
</div>
<a href="{{sectionurl}}" class="aicourse-card-link" aria-label="{{cardlinklabel}}"><h3 class="aicourse-card-title" data-for="section_title" data-id="{{sectionid}}" data-number="{{sectionnum}}">{{{sectionname}}}</h3></a>
{{#hassummary}}
<p class="aicourse-card-summary">{{summary}}</p>
{{/hassummary}}
{{#hasactivities}}
<ul class="aicourse-card-activities">
{{#activities}}
<li class="aicourse-card-activity" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-modname="{{modname}}"><a href="{{{url}}}" class="aicourse-card-activity-link" aria-label="{{label}}">{{!
}}<img class="aicourse-card-activity-icon" src="{{iconurl}}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy">{{!
}}<span class="aicourse-card-activity-name">{{{name}}}</span>{{!
}}{{#hastime}}<span class="aicourse-card-activity-time" aria-hidden="true">{{timetext}}</span>{{/hastime}}{{!
}}{{#istracked}}<span class="aicourse-card-activity-state {{stateclass}}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{/istracked}}{{!
}}</a></li>
{{/activities}}
{{#moreactivities}}
<li class="aicourse-card-activity"><a href="{{url}}" class="aicourse-card-activities-more" aria-label="{{label}}" title="{{label}}">+{{remaining}}</a></li>
{{/moreactivities}}
</ul>
{{/hasactivities}}
{{#hasfooter}}
<div class="aicourse-card-footer">
<div class="aicourse-card-footer-left">
{{#hascount}}
<a href="{{sectionurl}}" class="aicourse-activity-count" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{{counttext}}</a>
{{/hascount}}
{{#hasdots}}
<div class="aicourse-card-dots">
{{#dots}}
<a href="{{{url}}}" class="aicourse-card-dot {{statusclass}}" aria-label="{{label}}" title="{{label}}"></a>
{{/dots}}
{{#moredots}}
<a href="{{url}}" class="aicourse-card-dots-more" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" title="{{title}}">+{{remaining}}</a>
{{/moredots}}
</div>
{{/hasdots}}
</div>
{{#hasprogress}}
<a href="{{sectionurl}}" class="aicourse-card-progress" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-acf-ring="{{percentnum}}">{{!
}}<span class="aicourse-card-progress-bar"><span class="aicourse-card-progress-bar-fill" style="width:{{percentnum}}%"></span></span>{{!
}}<span class="aicourse-card-ring">{{!
}}<svg class="aicourse-card-ring-svg" viewBox="0 0 36 36" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">{{!
}}<circle class="aicourse-card-ring-track" cx="18" cy="18" r="16"></circle>{{!
}}<circle class="aicourse-card-ring-fill" cx="18" cy="18" r="16" stroke-dasharray="{{ringdash}} 100.53"></circle>{{!
}}</svg>{{!
}}<span class="aicourse-card-ring-text">{{percenttext}}</span>{{!
}}</span>{{!
}}</a>
{{/hasprogress}}
</div>
{{/hasfooter}}
</div>
